mission "The Western Return"
    name "The Western Return"
    description "Sail back to Port Royal and deliver the Outer Antilles reports to Commodore Bonny."
    source "Stormhaven"
    destination "Port Royal"
    lead "The harbourmaster points to a fresh dispatch nailed beside the tide table. “Stormhaven has asked for you by name. Commodore Bonny is there with a damaged packet and news from the eastern routes. You have earned time ashore; go when you are ready.”"
    reward 890
    speaker offer "Commodore Anne Bonny"
    speaker visit "Commodore Anne Bonny"
    speaker complete "Commodore Anne Bonny"
    to offer
        has "The Storm Line: done"
    on offer
        conversation
            `The free captains have called a council at Port Royal to plan the pursuit of Ashcombe.`
            `The Meridian Star sails west across open water. Its stores are low, but it remains faster and better armed than most ships in the islands.`
            `Bring the patrol schedule and the deserters' testimony to Commodore Bonny. She will decide where the free fleet should intercept Ashcombe.`
            choice
                `(I will take this voyage. Tell me the course.)`
                    goto accept_job
                `(What makes this business so important?)`
                    goto more_details
                `(I have other waters to sail.)`
                    goto decline_job
            label more_details
                `Bring the patrol schedule and the deserters' testimony to Commodore Bonny. She will decide where the free fleet should intercept Ashcombe.`
                choice
                    `(Then I will see it done.)`
                        goto accept_job
                    `(Not this time.)`
                        goto decline_job
            label accept_job
                `Last Light's harbourmaster watches your ship leave. “You have sailed beyond every chart I own, captain. Bring that knowledge home.”`
                accept
            label decline_job
                `The officer nods and rolls the chart closed. The offer will remain here if you change your mind.`
                close
    on accept
        log "Accepted The Western Return. Sail back to Port Royal and deliver the Outer Antilles reports to Commodore Bonny."
    on visit
        conversation
            `Bonny gathers the captains. Ashcombe is heading toward the Leeward Expanse to meet a fleet of hired ships.`
    on complete
        conversation
            `The pursuit will cross the open sea, away from the safety of the old ports.`
        log "Completed The Western Return. Received 890 gold. The pursuit will cross the open sea, away from the safety of the old ports."
